{"type":"standard","title":"Mokilese language","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Mokilese language</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q2335528","titles":{"canonical":"Mokilese_language","normalized":"Mokilese language","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Mokilese language</span></span>"},"pageid":8296305,"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1352242049","tid":"8ec77dae-468c-11f1-95a8-d0ffff3d6f21","timestamp":"2026-05-03T01:08:13Z","description":"Micronesian language","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mokilese_language","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mokilese_language?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mokilese_language?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Mokilese_language"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mokilese_language","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Mokilese_language","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mokilese_language?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Mokilese_language"}},"extract":"Mokilese, also known as Mwoakilloan, Mwokilese, or Mwoakilese, is a Micronesian language originally spoken on Mwoakilloa, Federated States of Micronesia. Of the 1200 Mokilese speakers, only about 500 live on Mwoakilloa.","extract_html":"<p><b>Mokilese</b>, also known as <b>Mwoakilloan</b>, <b>Mwokilese</b>, or <b>Mwoakilese</b>, is a Micronesian language originally spoken on Mwoakilloa, Federated States of Micronesia. Of the 1200 Mokilese speakers, only about 500 live on Mwoakilloa.</p>"}